# Free play, the SMK-37's top pad 7 (index 6): the keys play one GM sound with the band stopped, the screen names the
# note, the interval or the chord. Only the sound is kept: the songs, the band and every other setting are as before.
# (a shot waits for the screen's next frames; page 18: P_FREE; free_chord: root*100 + CH_* type, C major 0, Am7 918)
wait 300
snap
expect page 0
pad 6
expect page 18
wait 80
shot free_empty.png
# ---- a note: C4 (keybed key 12)
kbkey 12 down 100
expect free_n 1
expect free_low 60
wait 80
shot free_note.png
# ---- a chord: C E G, then let go (the last stays, dim)
kbkey 16 down 100
kbkey 19 down 100
expect free_n 3
expect free_chord 0
wait 80
shot free_chord.png
kbkey 12 up
kbkey 16 up
kbkey 19 up
expect free_n 0
expect free_chord 0
wait 80
shot free_last.png
# ---- Am7: A3 C4 E4 G4
kbkey 9 down 90
kbkey 12 down 90
kbkey 16 down 90
kbkey 19 down 90
expect free_chord 918
expect free_low 57
wait 80
shot free_am7.png
kbkey 9 up
kbkey 12 up
kbkey 16 up
kbkey 19 up
# ---- two notes: C4 and G4, their interval
kbkey 12 down 100
kbkey 19 down 100
expect free_n 2
wait 80
shot free_interval.png
kbkey 12 up
kbkey 19 up
# ---- the sound (K5 here: the simulator's K1), the volume (K2), a family on (PRESET)
spin K1 5
expect free_prog 5
spin K2 -20
expect free_vol 80
wait 80
shot free_sound.png
spin PRESET 1
expect free_prog 8
# ---- its own octave: OCT+ moves the keys here, not the project's octave
tap OCT+
kbkey 12 down 100
expect free_low 72
kbkey 12 up
tap OCT-
# ---- the staff: the black keys by the chord's key (Eb major: flats; D major: sharps)
kbkey 15 down 100
kbkey 19 down 100
kbkey 22 down 100
expect free_chord 300
expect free_flats 1
wait 80
shot free_staff_eb.png
kbkey 15 up
kbkey 19 up
kbkey 22 up
kbkey 14 down 100
kbkey 18 down 100
kbkey 21 down 100
expect free_chord 200
expect free_flats 0
wait 80
shot free_staff_d.png
kbkey 14 up
kbkey 18 up
kbkey 21 up
# a 2nd and ledger lines: C3 D3 (low) and C6 (high), the notes beside each other
kbkey 0 down 100
kbkey 2 down 100
kbkey 36 down 100
wait 80
shot free_staff_ledger.png
kbkey 0 up
kbkey 2 up
kbkey 36 up
# past the ledger lines: three octaves up, C9: an octave in, 8va
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
kbkey 36 down 100
expect free_low 120
wait 80
shot free_staff_8va.png
kbkey 36 up
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
# KNOB 4 (the simulator's K4): flats; KNOB 3: the staff off (the names alone, large)
spin K4 2
expect free_flats 1
kbkey 13 down 100
wait 80
shot free_staff_flat.png
kbkey 13 up
spin K3 -1
expect free_staff 0
wait 80
shot free_nostaff.png
spin K3 1
spin K4 -2
# ---- the band's controls do nothing here
pad 0
pad 8
expect page 18
fader 0 10
fader 1 120
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
tap REC
expect recording 0
tap SEL
sbtn KNOB_BANK
expect smkmap 0
spin SELECT 1
spin ALGO 1
expect page 18
# ---- out: pad 7 again, back where it was; nothing else changed
pad 6
expect page 0
expect unchanged 1
expect free_prog 8
# ---- help in Free play: a button held a second, its own card (the release does nothing); every card's words fit
pad 6
expect page 18
press PLAY
wait 1100
expect card 11
wait 80
shot free_card_play.png
release PLAY
expect page 18
expect playing 0
press HOME
wait 1100
expect card 7
wait 80
shot free_card_home.png
release HOME
expect page 18
press ARP
wait 1100
expect card 9
release ARP
expect page 18
press REC
wait 1100
release REC
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
press SAVE
wait 1100
release SAVE
press OCT+
wait 1100
release OCT+
press OCT-
wait 1100
release OCT-
press SEQ
wait 1100
release SEQ
press EDIT
wait 1100
release EDIT
press LFO
wait 1100
release LFO
press FX
wait 1100
release FX
press ENV
wait 1100
release ENV
press GLO
wait 1100
release GLO
sbtn KNOB_BANK down
wait 1100
expect card 15
wait 80
shot free_card_knob_bank.png
sbtn KNOB_BANK up
sbtn FADER_BANK down
wait 1100
sbtn FADER_BANK up
sbtn LEFT down
wait 1100
sbtn LEFT up
sbtn RIGHT down
wait 1100
sbtn RIGHT up
expect page 18
expect smkmap 0
expect fbank 0
pad 6
expect page 0
expect unchanged 1
# ---- from the Song page, PATCH (HOME) out to Home
tap HOME
expect page 1
pad 6
expect page 18
tap HOME
expect page 0
expect unchanged 1
